  "details": "The default state of the filters for the calendar between the website and in-game client are inverted.\n\nThis can cause confusion, as a single input from the user, such as selecting an option like \"Featured\" will only show content of said type on the website whilst it would exclude that content from the results for the in-game client.\n\nSelect \"Featured\" filter option\n\n- On the website, only \"Featured\" events will be shown\n\n- In-game, all events EXCEPT \"Featured\" ones will be shown",
